{"id":"e2d6ae13554de5c2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-abstract-rule-validity.md","title":"带标签推理的集合语义可靠性","display":"df-abstract-rule-validity — 带标签推理的集合语义可靠性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity","aliases":["72-df-abstract-rule-validity"],"display":"df-abstract-rule-validity — 带标签推理的集合语义可靠性","depends_on":[],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2 and Ch.III §3, print10–18,164–166/PDF22–30,176–178; local abstract interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-abstract-rule-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-rule-validity — 带标签推理的集合语义可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2 and Ch.III §3, print10–18,164–166/PDF22–30,176–178; local abstract interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在ZFC中固定集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,W,\\mathsf{Tag}\">\\(Q,W,\\mathsf{Tag}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq Q\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq Q\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}}\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^I\\times Q\">\\(\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}}\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^I\\times Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq Q\">\\(H\\subseteq Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为实例中的前提函数序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 为结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq H\\land\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq H\\land\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是保真集合的接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 可以是某结构下对全部赋值有效的相继式集合，也可由其他语义性质构成。空前提规则要求结论直接在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 中。规则的标签与见证仍保留在实例中；定义没有把“末结论有效”预先假定为每个证明的属性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Q,W,\\mathsf{Tag}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}}\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^I\\times Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\ (\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\subseteq H\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q\\in H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq H\\land\\operatorname{RuleValid}_{\\mathcal C}(H).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1838,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity|df-abstract-rule-validity — 带标签推理的集合语义可靠性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"规则语义可靠性：[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity|df-abstract-rule-validity — 带标签推理的集合语义可靠性]]"},{"id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$；$\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。$\\operatorname{Sound}$ 使用 [[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]] 的实例集合定义。"},{"id":"2e4e495c5c3c9961","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73245f799abb8dc9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,H$ 与 $\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}$ 取 [[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]；$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}$、$\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}$、$\\operatorname{Concl}$ 取 [[72-df-proof-tree]]，使用同一 $Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R$。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]"}],"outgoing":[]}